library "Quantity Threshold Intake".
concept "Measurement":
- shape is Record.
- type is Observation.
- value type is Quantity 'ms'.
- code is `measurement`.
- shape reduction is most recent.
presentation for "Measurement":
- question text is "Enter measurement (ms)".

concept "Threshold Met":
- shape is Record.
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- definition is "Measurement" at least 120 'ms'.
- shape reduction is most recent.
activity "Meets": - request CPGTaskRequest. - with `MEETS`.
activity "Does Not Meet": - request CPGTaskRequest. - with `DOES-NOT-MEET`.
decision "Assessment":
first:
- when "Threshold Met" then recommend activity "Meets".
- otherwise then recommend activity "Does Not Meet".
